<h1>Family History Projects</h1>
<h2>Family History Reports</h2>
<h3>Enquiry Stage</h3>
<p>All our Family history projects are extensively and comprehensively researched, undergo a three stage exquiry process.</p>
<p>Initially, this would be based upon the details submitted at enquiry stage, followed by conducting a preliminary research exercise. Upon completion a report making recommendation for consideration and approval is produced. This shall also detail anticipated costs to complete your family history project, along with supplementary cost if any. It will also advise of minimum retainer fee payable in advance via secure PayPal invoice, prior to any actual research being reported upon. PayPal provide various means of payment, including Credit/Debit Card facilities.</p>
<p>If nothing is discovered the client will always be informed.</p>
