  <li>Census Returns,</li>
  <li>Local Maps.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Family Trees</h3>
<p>Family Trees are excellent visual aids for understanding one’s family history projects; a diagram showing the relationship between people in several generations of a family. Most, but not all, would show Descendancy, Ascendancy, or a combination of both.</p>
<p>Included is on illustrating extended family taken from a local History project. In this case only the top layer of family tree is extended.</p>
